# Build Configuration

## Global Properties (Directory.Build.props)

These are set globally and must not be duplicated in individual csproj files:

- `LangVersion`: `latest`
- `AnalysisLevel`: `latest-recommended`
- `TreatWarningsAsErrors`: `true`
- `NoWarn`: `CA1716` (namespace naming is intentional)

## New Projects

- Do not set `LangVersion` — inherited from `Directory.Build.props`.
- Do not set `TreatWarningsAsErrors` — inherited globally.
- If the project has legitimate warnings to suppress, use `<NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CAXXXX</NoWarn>`.

## Test Projects

- Add `<NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CA1707;CA1716</NoWarn>` for underscored test method names.
- Set `<IsPackable>false</IsPackable>` and `<IsTestProject>true</IsTestProject>`.

## Artifacts

- Never commit `bin/` or `obj/` folders — these are in `.gitignore`.
- Published output goes to `publish/` (also gitignored).
